OL,3,GNEWSADistillers fear impact of English
OL,4,Awhisky change
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-founder of Birmingham's first
OL,7,Flicensed whisky distillery says he
OL,8,Ffears for the future of his business
OL,9,Fafter English whisky gained protected
OL,10,Fstatus.
OL,12,FAnthony Dillon, who runs Spirit of
OL,13,FBirmingham in South Yardley with his
OL,14,Fsister, Joanie, said the new
OL,15,FGeographical Indications (GIs) for
OL,16,FEnglish whisky could stop some
OL,17,Fproducers describing their products as
OL,18,FEnglish single malt.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
