OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSADistillers fear impact of English
OL,4,Awhisky change
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtected status already applies to
OL,7,Fproducts including Cornish pasties,
OL,8,Fwhile campaigners are seeking similar
OL,9,Fprotections for the Birmingham Balti.
OL,11,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,12,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) said the
OL,13,Fstatus protects the reputation of
OL,14,FEnglish single malt whisky.
